{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/b5e5d3ce1d45a3d28c5bb029928ed5f5.avif?t=1757581432\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.poster.avif?t=1757581432\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.webm?t=1757581432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678910/extras/41a06e08ed4e18bbe8407ae6e47af115.mp4?t=1757581432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Blast is an arcade shooter where you control a cannon and destroy rocks falling from the sky. Upgrade your gear to complete levels and beat powerful bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every rock has a number\u2014hit it that many times and boom! it splits into two rocks with half the number and double the speed, turning the field into fast-moving chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend for double firepower. Beat hundreds of levels, survive endless waves, and climb the world leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up coins and unlock new cannons: a wide-spread shotgun, a boomerang that swings back and spinning saw blades that slice through rocks as they fall. Upgrade power-ups like a piercing laser beam, explosive drones, and huge shockwaves to wipe out waves in a flash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP: Team up with a friend and fend off the falling rocks together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Leaderboards: Survive as long as you can and get the best score in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Cannons: Choose between basic, shotgun, boomerang, and saw cannons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating powers: Buy and upgrade powerful abilities to destroy everything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Levels: Defeat epic bosses and protect the bridge from destruction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability: Complete hundreds of unique levels and challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rocks won\u2019t stop bouncing\u2014are you ready to keep blasting?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blast & protect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/db90b6c8f69eed22bd50214c6ce060ae14a4af88.jpg"},{"name":"Baby steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/366854dbe2a75d6381d27adf4f91f8d046c7b803.jpg"},{"name":"Respect!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/805836d814435a52968517fbe3bad8fc5b176521.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/5822e05b55a2c95bd5ac6caf1359d507902ccfa3.jpg"},{"name":"Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/415bb90fa20ba161b9947eb4810b24679c9e5edb.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/c8c9cd7aacc7d7cab72c47877f554fbce0525454.jpg"},{"name":"Star Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/36baa4d25c67e64bb27f54a0230ff2b81cc22ed5.jpg"},{"name":"Proficient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3678910/ac40bcc70bd8df4d06fa671f1eb543a85a56fb76.jpg"},{"name":"Skillful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm